      "A sales budget estimates units sold and sales value. Sales value = budgeted units × selling price. A production budget links sales demand to stock targets: production units = sales units + desired closing finished goods − opening finished goods. The closing inventory of one month becomes the next month's opening inventory. Production is not always equal to sales.",
